================================================================================
WHERE THE TWO MEASUREMENTS DIVERGE, AND WHY
================================================================================

  A wider input set is not monotonically better for this rule, and these rows
  are the proof: adding archives can DESTROY a witness, because a fat shaded
  artifact vendors what a smaller module ships, and it can also SUPPLY one,
  because a module absent from the narrow set is present in the full one. The
  two results are therefore two measurements and are never totalled together.

